7.2 Ticket Management

The Support Desk workspace must include:

- All tickets assigned to the current operator.
- Department ticket queue.
- Unassigned tickets.
- Open tickets.
- Pending tickets.
- Waiting-for-customer tickets.
- Resolved tickets.
- Closed tickets.
- Ticket search.
- Advanced filtering.
- Sorting and pagination.
- Customer history.
- Ticket priority.
- Ticket status.
- Ticket assignment.
- Department reassignment.
- Operator reassignment.
- Internal notes.
- Conversation history.
- Attachments.
