- Enable or disable the AI assistant per department.
- Select authorized Knowledge Base collections per department.
- Configure department-specific AI welcome and fallback messages.

Creating and activating a department must automatically add its button to the public landing page.

No code modification or redeployment should be required.

9.3 Operator Management

